513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (In the end, the development of AdaLoHA means that high-fidelity artistic mastery is no longer restricted to those with elite hardware. For you as a researcher or artist, this research provides a robust, resource-efficient pathway to fine-tune massive generative models on standard, accessible GPUs.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
514 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (By resolving the efficiency-fidelity trade-off, AdaLoHA establishes that stability is achievable even when aggressively reducing model complexity. This contributes directly to the ethical democratization of AI technology, ensuring that creative innovation can thrive in resource-poor environments while respecting the nuanced integrity of the original artist's style. Ultimately, this hybrid approach proves that we can achieve "smarter fine-tuning" that is both computationally frugal and artistically superior.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
